{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Leefsituatie Werkenden en Werkzoekenden 1995 - LWW1995"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:114475"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau (SCP)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"SCP  Databeheerder"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De enquête LWW1995 verschaft inzicht in de leefsituatie van werkenden, werkzoekenden. Bij LWW1995 wordt onderzocht of werklozen en arbeidsongeschikten op een aantal aspecten in hun levenswijze, denken en handelen afwijken van werkenden. En zo ja, op welke wijze. In de enquête worden vragen gesteld over de volgende terreinen: financieel, psychologisch, gezondheid, sociale contacten, tijdsbesteding, politiek en voor- en nadelen van niet-werken en werken en de afweging daarvan. De vragenlijst hanteerde aparte vragenblokken voor werkenden, werklozen en arbeidsongeschikten.<\/p><p>Het onderzoek naar de leefsituatie van werkenden en niet-werkenden is uitgevoerd in aansluiting op de Enquête Beroepsbevolking (EBB). De te onderzoeken personen zijn geselecteerd uit de EBB van november 1994 - februari 1995.<br>De netto-steekproef is herwogen en opgehoogd naar de populatietotalen van de EBB 1994.<\/p><p>Enquêtemethode: mondeling interview computerondersteund (CAPI)<br>Steekproef: 2.794 personen<br>Netto respons: 2.251 personen (80.6%)<br>Veldwerkperiode: 1 februari 1995 t\/m 5 mei 1995<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"leefsituatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"werkenden"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"werklozen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsongeschikten"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"De dataset van LWW1995 is december 2018 beschikbaar gesteld bij DANS EASY"},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1995-06-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2018-12-07"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2018-12-07"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Enquête beroepsbevolking (EBB) van november 1994 t\/m februari 1995"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRight